{
  "uid": "stacks-ask",
  "title": "Ask the library",
  "description": "Daily totals for the Ask the library Worker, from pnpm ask:status --record. Panel 1 asks whether a day was recorded at all; every other panel reads only those days. Provisioned from grafana/dashboards/ask.json in the stacks repository.",
  "tags": ["stacks"],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this page",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Panel 1 answers *is this real*: a day with no bar there has no record, because `pnpm ask:status --record` was not run while its logs were kept. Read every other panel only for days panel 1 shows.**\n\nEvery figure is a count or a sum from the Worker's counts-only log lines ([`docs/spec/ask-observability.md`](https://github.com/mephistopheles4/stacks/blob/main/docs/spec/ask-observability.md)). Nothing here names a visitor: a *visitor-day* is one address's count for one UTC day, so a shared address reads as one heavy visitor and an IPv6 /48 spread over many /64s reads as many light ones. Provisioned from `grafana/dashboards/ask.json` in the stacks repository.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Panel 1 · Days with a record (a gap is a missed run, not a quiet day)",
      "description": "One bar per UTC day ask:status recorded. Read the panels below only for days with a bar.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "stacks-trend"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "stacks-trend"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "last_over_time(stacks_ask_day_recorded[1d])",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1d",
          "legendFormat": "recorded"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 86400000,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Panel 2 · Neurons a day, against the $0.09 spend limit (8,182)",
      "description": "Cloudflare's own Neurons, summed from the log lines, the daily test's included. ⚠️ The gateway's limit is a sliding window, so a budget refusal can come on a day whose total is under the line. A timed-out call's spend is unknown and not counted, so a day with timeouts is a lower bound. Lines with no Neurons are counted in panel 3.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "stacks-trend"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "stacks-trend"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "last_over_time(stacks_ask_neurons[1d])",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1d",
          "legendFormat": "Neurons"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "stacks-trend"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "last_over_time(stacks_ask_neurons_missing[1d])",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1d",
          "legendFormat": "spending lines with no Neurons"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 86400000,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
